<title>BELGIUM: EU reviews Brazil silicon import dumping measures.</title>
<headline>EU reviews Brazil silicon import dumping measures.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission will review anti-dumping duties imposed on Brazilian silicon metal imports, the European Union's Official Journal said.</p>
<p>Two Brazilian companies, Companhia Brasileira Carbureto da Calcio and Rima Industrial S.A. requested the review.</p>
<p>They said that the duties, imposed in 1992, were no longer necessary to offset dumping because their export prices are now substantially higher.</p>
<p>Those wishing to submit views and evidence are invited to do so within 40 days of publication of notice 97/C3/03 in the Official Journal on January 7.</p>
</text>
